{#
  « Rapprocher un virement » — the dialog of « Finances » for a payment
  that came in without the booking's communication: a renter's insurer
  settling a damage, a relative paying for them (#980, chantier §2.6).

  The manager types the amount received — mandatory — and, if they know
  it, the payer's name. The search posts it (POST, never in a URL) and
  the list comes back rendered by `_finance_transfer_candidates.html.twig`,
  placed in `[data-transfer-results]` by
  public/assets/js/rental-transfer-reconcile.js: only the unreconciled
  credits of the asset's account, since the first contract went out, of
  that exact amount. **Never the account's whole list**: a manager is not
  a treasurer, and every candidate is somebody's money.

  The dialog says how far the account is known: with no statement
  imported since the search starts, nothing that came in since can be
  found, and the page says so rather than letting an empty list read as
  « nothing arrived ».

  Requires `asset`, `booking`, `booking_page`, `transfer_available`,
  `transfer_since` and `transfer_statement_at`
  (RentalManagementController::transferContext()).
#}
<div data-booking-panel="payment-transfer">
    {% if transfer_available|default(false) %}
        {% embed 'partials/modal.html.twig' with {
            id: 'rapprocher-virement',
            title: 'Rapprocher un virement',
            size: 'lg',
            asset: asset, booking: booking, booking_page: booking_page,
            transfer_since: transfer_since, transfer_statement_at: transfer_statement_at,
        } only %}
            {% block body %}
                <p class="small">
                    Le site cherche parmi les virements entrants du compte de ce bien qui ne sont rapprochés de
                    rien, reçus depuis le {{ transfer_since|date_fr }}, ceux du montant exact que vous indiquez.
                    Celui que vous choisissez compte en entier comme un paiement de {{ booking.reference }}.
                </p>
                {% include '@rental/management/_finance_transfer_statement.html.twig' %}
                <form method="post" action="/mes-locations/virement-chercher" id="transfer-search-form"
                      data-transfer-search data-async="off">
                    {{ csrf_field()|raw }}
                    <input type="hidden" name="asset_id" value="{{ asset.id }}">
                    <input type="hidden" name="booking_id" value="{{ booking.id }}">
                    <input type="hidden" name="booking_page" value="{{ booking_page.value }}">
                    <div class="row g-2 align-items-end">
                        <div class="col-sm-4">
                            <label class="form-label" for="transfer-amount">Montant reçu (€)</label>
                            <input type="text" class="form-control" id="transfer-amount" name="amount"
                                   inputmode="decimal" autocomplete="off" required>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-sm-5">
                            <label class="form-label" for="transfer-payer">
                                Nom du payeur <span class="text-body-secondary">(facultatif)</span>
                            </label>
                            <input type="text" class="form-control" id="transfer-payer" name="payer_name"
                                   maxlength="100" autocomplete="off">
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-sm-3">
                            <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary w-100 w-sm-auto">Chercher</button>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </form>
                <div class="mt-3" data-transfer-results aria-live="polite"></div>
            {% endblock %}
            {% block footer %}
                <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline-secondary" data-bs-dismiss="modal">Fermer</button>
            {% endblock %}
        {% endembed %}
    {% endif %}
</div>
